{{Quote|Time to rock and roll!|Cannonbolt's first pun.<ref name="TBT"/>}}
'''Cannonbolt''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarota]]<ref>[[Leader Alien]]</ref><ref name="TBT" /> from the destroyed planet [[Arburia (Classic)|Arburia]].{{Refn|''[[Ben 10: The Complete Season 2]]''|group = DVD}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Cannonbolt===
Cannonbolt is a hulking, broad-shouldered alien covered in natural, yellow exo-plates{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}} on his back, shoulders, and the backs of his arms. He is mostly white with black on his upper half and has four claws on both of his hands. Cannonbolt is covered in fur across the thickest parts of his body, while every other part except for his elbows and knees is short fur.{{Refn|[[:File:Where Cannonbolt Has Fur.png]]|group = DR}}

When Cannonbolt turns into a sphere, he rolls up into a ball, with his backplates and the plates on his hands covering him. His sphere form has semi-circular stripes across his body, with black lines around the circular plates, and his side plates are the plates on his shoulders. It is described as a position similar to a [[wikipedia:Armadillidiidae|roly poly]].<ref>[[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex Salazar]]</ref><ref name="HU"/>

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Cannonbolt had sharp teeth, yellow eyes, and wore the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol on his forehead.

In ''[[Game Over]]'', while inside ''[[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]]'', he wore black underwear with a brown outline and had a ponytail.

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Cannonbolt's teeth became fuller and human-like, the black stripe on his chest was gone, his eyes were recolored green, and he wore the original Omnitrix/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Cannonbolt looks exactly the same as his '''Alien Force/Ultimate Alien''' design, but his colors were altered to fit '''Generator Rex'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s art style.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Cannonbolt regains his black stripe from the '''Original Series''', which now goes down to his belly/chest. His eyes are no longer connected to his shoulders, his palms are now flat instead of bulging, the yellow bolts on his body are now hexagonal and there are three plates on his back instead of two. Depending on the episode, Cannonbolt's teeth is either dull or sharp like his previous series' designs.

16-year-old Cannonbolt wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest, while 11-year-old Cannonbolt wears the original Omnitrix symbol (which has been recolored green) on his forehead to reflect his original appearance.

===Ben 10,000 as Cannonbolt ===
[[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s Cannonbolt looked similar to his 10-year-old self, but with a different color scheme for the legs, which sported a black pants-like design. His claws were longer and outlined in grey, his eyes were closer to his shoulder armor, and the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] symbol was higher up, being on the top of his head rather than his forehead.

===Gwen 10 as Cannonbolt===
[[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as Cannonbolt looks similar to [[Rollaway]], albeit the markings on her eyes are upturned, similar to eyeliner. She has feminine lips, freckles, a hair clip on her left side, pink eyes, and a cat symbol-shaped [[Omnitrix (Gweniverse)|Omnitrix]] on her chest. Her skin is light blue, while her bolts and lips are dark blue. She has black markings on her torso and pelvis in a similar design to a bikini. Her bolts are also smaller than Ben's Cannonbolt and Rollaway.

When curled into her shell, Cannonbolt looks just like Rollaway in his shell.

