{{Quote|"You're like a bowling ball!"<br>"More like a cannonball!"|[[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and Cannonbolt.<ref name="TBT" />}}
Cannonbolt can curl into a ball, encasing himself in his plating. In general, the [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarota]] species mostly used this maneuver for defense, like an [[Wikipedia:Armadillo|armadillo]]. However, since [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] did not know about this when discovering Cannonbolt, he weaponized Cannonbolt's originally defensive capabilities. Cannonbolt is nigh-invulnerable when curled into a ball{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt's Shell.png]]|group = DJW}}, so invulnerable that he can survive a fall from [[Earth (Classic)|Earth's]] atmosphere without suffering damage.<ref name="BAotD">''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]''</ref><ref name="ATTWB">''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref>

When rolled up, Cannonbolt becomes like a motorized wheel that can move at great speed (because of chemicals in his exo-plates that reduce friction){{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Chemicals.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Game Over" /> and can increase his rotational momentum to slam into and/or run over enemies. Cannonbolt is able to maneuver around his surroundings in ball form thanks to the short fur on his body, registering shifts in air and motion around him. Between that and his excellent hearing, Cannonbolt receives something akin to echolocation - giving him "eyeless" vision.{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Fur Sensors.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Has Fur.png]]|group = DR}}

Cannonbolt can ricochet and bounce off surfaces like a pinball in sphere form, suffering little-to-no loss in momentum.<ref name="TBT" /> Cannonbolt can also house people and fairly large objects within his spheroid form and provide them the same level of protection that he has.<ref name="BAotD" /> In his spherical form, he can bounce to create shockwaves or spin into a fierce tornado.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/55RhRKbRM-A%7C|group = CN}}

Cannonbolt possesses enhanced strength, being able to fight on par with enemies about his size.<ref>''[[No Honor Among Bros]]''</ref> He can also break free from traps made of [[Lepidopterran (Classic)|Lepidopterran]] slime.<ref>''[[Grudge Match]]''</ref> Cannonbolt also has enhanced reflexes, being able to quickly dodge most attacks.<ref name="VMC">''[[Vilgax Must Croak]]''</ref>

Cannonbolt possesses enhanced digging, as seen when he quickly tunneled underground in his sphere form before jumping out to attack [[Vilgax (Original Future)|future Vilgax]].<ref name="Ben10K">''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]''</ref>

Cannonbolt is capable of withstanding the vacuum of space, but he still needs to breathe. Without an oxygen supply, Cannonbolt is limited to holding his breath.<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref>

From inside his shell, Cannonbolt can withstand twice the heat of reentry into the Earth's atmosphere.{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt's Exo-Shells.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="BAotD" />  Similarly, his shell is resistant to acids and lava,<ref name="Benwolf">''[[Benwolf]]''</ref>{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Omniverse: Aliens at War]]''; [[:File:OV AAW DVD Cannonbolt Data.png|file]]|group = DVD|name = AD}} as well as cold temperatures of places such as [[Mikd'lty]],<ref>''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref> and can withstand the plasma generated by members of [[Ball Weevil]]'s [[Ball Weevil's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Can Withstand Ball Weevil's Plasma.png]]|group = DJW}}

Cannonbolt's shell can deflect lasers<ref name="TBT" /> and conduct electricity, such as that generated by a [[Gimlinopithecus]].<ref name="ATTWB" />

Cannonbolt can be empowered by electricity, such as those generated by a [[Gimlinopithecus]]. This way, he can gain much more power and momentum when in sphere form.<ref name="ATTWB" />

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
====[[Ben 10: Protector of Earth|Protector of Earth]]====
Cannonbolt can create a sonic boom by sucking in air from his surroundings and then expelling it.

Cannonbolt can create a strong, fast-spinning tornado.

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
Tick (830).png|Top-Heavy Body
Duped (416).png|Slippery Surfaces
VG (286).png|Sticky Surfaces
FaFBM (180).png|Constrained by Large Size
Return (939).png|Electricity Vulnerability (Outside of Shell)
Galactic (1376).png|Intense Heat Vulnerability (Outside of Shell)
</gallery>
Cannonbolt's bipedal form is top-heavy, making him very unbalanced and clumsy. This is because [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarota]]s are made to spin, not walk.{{Refn|[[:File:Arburian Pelarotas Spin.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Game Over" />

Cannonbolt cannot roll over slippery surfaces, such as a [[Gourmand]]'s slime spit, as it will cause him to immediately uncurl from his sphere form and fall over.<ref name="Duped">''[[Duped]]''</ref>

Cannonbolt can be trapped by strong adhesives, such as those used by the [[Stalker]].<ref>''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]''</ref> Similarly, he can be held in place by beings with as much strength as a [[Chimera Sui Generis (Classic)|Chimera Sui Generis]].<ref name="Ben10K" />

Cannonbolt's large body makes it hard for him to move in small spaces, such as in vehicles like the [[Proto-TRUK]].<ref name="FaFBM" />

Cannonbolt can be incapacitated by electricity when not curled into a ball, such as that generated by a [[Transylian]].<ref>''[[The Return]]''</ref> Similarly, Cannonbolt can be burned by extremely hot objects when not curled into a ball.<ref>''[[The Galactic Enforcers]]''</ref>

In his uncurled form, Cannonbolt can be controlled by a [[Vladat]] via their [[Corruptura]]s.{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Can Be Affected by Corruptura.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Cannonbolt first appeared in ''[[The Big Tick]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked by [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], and [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] could not figure out what powers he had aside from rolling around and decided Cannonbolt was useless in battle. Later, however, he realized Cannonbolt can be rather useful by defeating the [[Great One]] when all of his other aliens failed.
*In ''[[The Galactic Enforcers]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[SixSix (Classic)|SixSix]] and [[Vulkanus]].
*In ''[[Grudge Match]]'', Cannonbolt defeated [[Kevin 11]] and escaped the [[Megacruiser]] with [[Technorg]]'s help.
*In ''[[Camp Fear]]'', Cannonbolt saved [[Gilbert]] from falling.
* In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Cannonbolt hid from Kevin 11 and [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] and later fought a [[Null Guardian]].
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[Vilgax (Original Future)|future Vilgax]] before [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] switched him into [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]].
*In ''[[A Change of Face]]'', Gwen accidentally transformed into Cannonbolt while in Ben's body and battled [[Charmcaster (Classic)|Charmcaster]] and her [[Rock Monster]]s. After Gwen and Ben were put back in their own respective bodies, Ben as Cannonbolt defeated Charmcaster.
*In ''[[Benwolf]]'', Cannonbolt defeated the [[Werewolf]].
*In ''[[Game Over]]'', Cannonbolt defeated some of [[Kenko]]'s minions and accidentally made [[Ishiyama]] lose a life in the process. Upon reaching level 13, Cannonbolt prepared to fight Kenko, but reverted before he could.
*In ''[[The Return]]'', Cannonbolt fought the Werewolf, the [[Mummy]], and [[Dr. Viktor]].
*In ''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]'', Cannonbolt fell onto [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] from space with [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and Gwen.
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', Cannonbolt broke into [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s lab with enough force after he failed to open the door twice.
*In ''[[Don't Drink the Water]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[Hex (Classic)|Hex]].
*In ''[[Big Fat Alien Wedding]]'', Cannonbolt stopped a truck from crashing into the wedding stage and accidentally set the stage chairs on fire, but managed to put out the flames by jumping into the lake, causing a massive splash. After escaping [[Gordon Tennyson|Gordon]] and [[Betty Jean Tennyson|Betty Jean]] with Gwen's help, he followed and was defeated by [[Camille Mann|Camille]]'s [[Camille's Ex-Boyfriend|ex-boyfriend]] just before he reverted.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[Malware]].
*In ''[[The Ballad of Mr. Baumann]]'', Cannonbolt wrongfully attacked the [[Tentacle Vendor]] and tried to fight [[Vulkanus]] before reverting.

===Alien Force=== 
*Cannonbolt was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.
*In ''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]'', Cannonbolt was re-unlocked by the Master Control, and battled an army of [[DNAlien]]s and reverted some of them back into [[Human (Classic)|humans]] until he was tired out.
*In ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 1]]'', Cannonbolt defeated [[Ssserpent]].
*In ''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]'', Cannonbolt fought [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] and kicked him into the [[Codon Stream]].

===Ultimate Alien=== 
*In ''[[Fame]]'', Cannonbolt was seen on TV.
*In ''[[Duped]]'', Cannonbolt was used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Sensitive Ben]] to battle [[Sir Urien]], but was defeated.
*In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Cannonbolt was defeated by the [[Stalker]], so he switched into [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]].
*In ''[[Too Hot to Handle]]'', Cannonbolt went [[Ultimate Cannonbolt|Ultimate]] to get [[P'Andor]] back into his [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit|containment suit]].
*In ''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]'', Cannonbolt escaped the [[Mikd'lty]] temple with Gwen and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]].
*In ''[[Where the Magic Happens]]'', Cannonbolt defeated some [[Rock Monster]]s and escaped from [[Addwaitya]].
*In ''[[Perplexahedron (Episode)|Perplexahedron]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[Ultimate Aggregor]] until he went Ultimate. Cannonbolt appeared again later when he was changing back to Ben.
*In ''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]'', Cannonbolt went Ultimate to chase and fight [[Sunder]]. Cannonbolt appeared again later when he was changing back to Ben.
*In ''[[The Big Story]]'', a [[Plant Clone Ben|Plant Clone of Ben]] used Cannonbolt to chase after [[Jimmy Jones|Jimmy]].
*In ''[[Revenge of the Swarm]]'', Cannonbolt briefly fought a clone of [[Dr. Victor Valadis]] before switching into [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]].
*In ''[[It's Not Easy Being Gwen]]'', Cannonbolt battled [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] and his [[Mutant Frog]] twice before going Ultimate.
* In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Cannonbolt saved [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]] from [[Alpha]]. Later, Cannonbolt was shot from Rex's Slam Cannon to obtain the [[Omega-1 Nanite]] from Alpha's body.
**Also, Cannonbolt appeared as one of the many aliens when Ben was explaining his story to Rex.
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Cannonbolt was seen confronting [[Albedo]] in a dream.

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[The More Things Change: Part 1]]'', Cannonbolt tried to stop [[Liam]], [[Fistina]], and [[Bubble Helmet]] from robbing [[Baumann's]] while also accidentally causing damage to it, much to [[Ignacius Baumann|Mr. Baumann]]'s grief.
*In ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', Cannonbolt protected himself from a new weapon that [[Blukic]] and [[Driba]] were testing.
*In ''[[Vilgax Must Croak]]'', Cannonbolt defeated [[Empress Attea|General Attea]], [[SixSix (Classic)|SixSix]], [[SevenSeven]], and [[EightEight]].
*In ''[[Return to Forever]]'', Cannonbolt tried to break out of a force field, but was reverted by the [[Forever Knights]]' [[DNA Scanner]].
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Cannonbolt was about to battle a [[Slammoid]] before it fled at the sight of [[Khyber]], [[Khyber's Panuncian|his Panuncian]], and [[Crabdozer (Transformation)|Crabdozer]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Cannonbolt fended off [[Khyber's Ship]] in space being rescued by Rook.
*In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] as Cannonbolt knocked the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]'s pod towards a [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|young Ben Prime]] during the events of ''[[And Then There Were 10]]''.
**In the same episode [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as Cannonbolt fought [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].
*In ''[[The Vengers]]'', Cannonbolt fought the [[Vengers]].
*In ''[[No Honor Among Bros]]'', Cannonbolt was defeated by [[Fistina]].
*In ''[[The Final Countdown]]'', Cannonbolt saved the [[Plumbers (Classic)|Plumbers]] from the launching [[Plumber Headquarters|Plumber HQ]].
* In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Cannonbolt appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===  
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', Cannonbolt fought [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Dr. Animo]].
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Cannonbolt fought [[Sploot]] before switching into [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]. Later, he battled Devlin's mutant form before switching into [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]].

===Goodbye and Good Riddance (What-If?)===  
*In ''[[Goodbye and Good Riddance]]'', Cannonbolt battled Vilgax and saved [[Carl Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|Carl]] from him.

