====[[Ben 10: Protector of Earth]]====
Cannonbolt is a playable alien in the game.

He has the Dark Heroes and the DNA Force skin. Cannonbolt is needed for defeating [[Snap Dragon]].

Cannonbolt can curl into a ball to encase himself in his plating, turning into a sphere. He can then use this form to roll into enemies to attack. In addition to the average repelling of walls, he is capable of ricocheting off enemies as well.

By compressing himself tightly, Cannonbolt can release the pressure to create a sonic blast.

Cannonbolt can flop onto the ground to create a shockwave, as well as rotate quickly to generate a miniature tornado.

====[[Ben 10 Alien Force: Vilgax Attacks]]====
Cannonbolt is a playable alien in the game, replacing [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]] in the Xbox 360, Nintendo Wii, PlayStation 2, and PlayStation Portable versions of the game. However, Cannonbolt is replaced by [[Upchuck|Murk Upchuck]] in the Nintendo DS version of the game.

Due to the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] rebooting after [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s abuse of the quick-change feature during his battle with an animated [[Mr. Smoothy (Classic)|Mr. Smoothy]] mascot, Cannonbolt, along with [[Swampfire]], [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]], [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]], and [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] were the only aliens available on Ben's arsenal upon his arrival on [[Vulpin]].

Cannonbolt can curl into a ball, encasing himself in his plating. Cannonbolt is able to launch himself from ramps located all over the alien worlds to cross long gaps, as well as insert himself in special slots and use his rotation to power or destroy machinery and reveal hidden structures.

Superball is an unlockable combo move for Cannonbolt.

Cannonbolt is vital for progression on the Vulpin, [[Terradino (Classic)|Terradino]], [[Encephalonus IV]], [[Anur Phaetos]], [[MorOtesi]], and [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]] levels of the game.

====[[Punch Time Explosion XL]]====
Cannonbolt is one of the aliens used by 10-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]. His design is identical to his appearance in ''[[Ben 10 Alien Force: Vilgax Attacks|Vilgax Attacks]]'', despite being used by Young Ben.

