==Trivia==
*Cannonbolt was the first additional alien to be unlocked in the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]. He was also the only alien to be manually (and accidentally) unlocked by [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]].
**Cannonbolt was also the first additional alien [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] transformed into in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]'''.
*After Season 2 of the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', when [[Zs'Skayr]] successfully escapes the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] and thus removing Ghostfreak from it, Cannonbolt replaces the latter in the intro for the third and fourth seasons.
*Cannonbolt is one of the five aliens who have appeared in all series in the Classic Continuity; the other four are [[Upchuck]], [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]], [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], and [[Ghostfreak]]. 
**Currently, Cannonbolt, Diamondhead, and Way Big are the only three of these aliens to have appeared in all series of the [[Ben 10 (Franchise)|franchise]].
*Cannonbolt was originally planned to be one of the playable aliens in the ''[[Game Creator]]'' but was soon removed from the game entirely when '''Alien Force''' aired. 
**However, he was eventually brought back for the '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' version of the game.
*[[Dave Johnson]] did the initial concepts for Cannonbolt, which had knobs that activated rocket blasts to bounce around and later became [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax's]] [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]], while the final design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Dave Johnson Designed Cannonbolt Concepts.png]]|group = TNP}}{{Refn|https://archive.is/Js8I1|group = DJ}}
*Cannonbolt was initially meant to be one of the original 10 aliens, but ended up being replaced with Diamondhead.{{Refn|[[:File:I10 Quick Facts CANNONBOLT.png]]|group = pop-up}}{{Refn|''[[I-10: The Ben 10 User Generated Experience]]''|group = CN}}
*Cannonbolt was originally supposed to be used by [[Albedo]] in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}

